{
  "_about": "Run The Pitch's club names and club identities, decided once. scripts/convertData.js applies them. `same` maps a spelling found in the World Cup rosters to the one spelling of that name (Al Hilal to Al-Hilal); it never renames a club. club_at_tournament keeps the NAME OF THE TIME, and club_id is one stable id per club across its names (the owner's ruling, 2026-11-26: a club that changed its name is one club, shown under the name it had then). The id is the slug of the name unless `eras` gives one id to several names of one club, or `ids` sets it to keep two clubs apart whose names slug alike. `apart` lists names that normalize alike but are different clubs, checked against the players' nations and years. `display` is a short name per club_id for the game to show if set (the owner is weighing names like 'Man U'); empty means show the name of the time. `not_a_club` is cleared to null: the 1994 United States squad was contracted to its federation. scripts/check-soccer-clubs.mjs holds all of it.",
